    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Cronin Wall Properties are thrilled to welcome, this beautifully presented, 3-bedroom home to the sales market. Elm Grove is a desirable and family orientated location which is conveniently within a couple of minutes' walk from a large selection of amenities in Castlemartyr including Greengrocers, Chemist, National School, Pubs, Castlemartyr Resort Hotel and Post Office as well as clear access to the N25.\r\n\r\nThe property is impecably presented throughout with beautiful decor instantly boasting a cosy and inviting interior. In addition, the property boasts a beautiful, low maintenance garden to the rear with shed and side access. Castlemartyr is only a mere 5-minute drive from the beautiful blue flag beach in Garryvoe whilst still only 8km from Midleton Town where a further range of amenities can be availed of.\r\n\r\nViewing this absolute turn-key home is a must.\r\n\r\nAccommodation consists of: Entrance Hallway, Living Room, Master Bedroom, Bedroom 2, Bedroom 3, Kitchen, Dining Area, W.C., Bathroom, En Suite, Attic and Back Garden.  Room sizes are indicative only\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway 3.86 x 1.71m Carpeted flooring, Radiator, Light Fixture, Alarm.\r\n\r\nLiving Room & Dining Area 6.28 x 5.39m Wood effect flooring, fireplace with mantle, Radiator, Overhead light fixtures, shelving units, storage units.\r\n\r\nKitchen: 1.99m x 2.54m Overhead light fixture, Washing Machine, Electric hob & Oven unit, Built-in Storage units, Built-in Fridge Freezer.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom: 3.69m x 3.17m Overhead light fixture, Wardrobe, En-suite.\r\n\r\nEn-suite: 2.92m x 0.92m Tiled flooring, Shower tiling, Electric shower, Glass shower door, shower door, sink, w.c.\r\n\r\nBathroom: 2.55m x 1.68m Tiled flooring, w.h.b with vanity unit, w.c, tiled shower unit with electric shower, towel heater, light fixture, overhead heater.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 2.68m x 2.93m - Light fixture, Radiator.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: 2.68m x 1.78m Built - in wardrobe, radiator, light fixture, storage.\r\n\r\nFeatures Include:\r\n\r\n* 3 Bedroom, end of terrace house\r\n* Desirable location\r\n* Gas central heating\r\n* Maintained and decorated to an extremely high standard\r\n* Master Bedroom with En-suite\r\n* Stunning rear garden with side access and shed\r\n* Guest W.C.\r\n* French doors in Living Room leading to rear garden large green area\r\n* Within walking distance local amenities in Castlemartyr Village\r\n* Easy access to the Main N25\r\n\r\n\r\nBuilding Energy Rating (BER):\r\nBER: B3\r\nBER No. 115352551\r\nEnergy Performance Indicator: 142.46 kWh/m2/yr\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDirections:\r\nTravelling from Cork to Castlemartyr on the Main N25 road, in Castlemartyr Village continue straight over the bridge and through the traffic lights. Take the left turn which will bring you into the Maples. For Sale sign erected at the property.\r\n\r\n\r\nEircode: P25 CH26\r\n\r\n\r\nViewings:\r\nStrictly by prior appointment with the sole selling agent."
      },
